        <mxCell id="tWebTxt" parent="t1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(180, 83, 9);&quot;&gt;epic-web&lt;/b&gt; — Angular 20 SPA&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(71, 85, 105);&quot;&gt;Static hosting: &lt;b&gt;S3 + CloudFront&lt;/b&gt; (no server)&lt;br&gt;DNS: epic-{env}.nonprod.pge.com (Route 53 private alias to CF)&lt;br&gt;Public ACM cert in us-east-1&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;WAFv2&lt;/b&gt; (CLOUDFRONT scope, us-east-1) — IP allow-list of PG&amp;amp;E public egress CIDRs only&lt;br&gt;Identity: X-Epic-User header (placeholder)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
